<title>ITALY: TENNIS-CORRETJA WINS ITALIAN OPEN TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CORRETJA WINS ITALIAN OPEN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the  $2.3 million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>10-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 7-5 7-5 6-3 </p>
<p>Doubles:</p>
<p>3-Mark Knowles (Bahamas)/Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat 5-Byron Black (Zimbabwe)/Alex O'Brien (U.S.) 6-3 4-6 7-5</p>
</text>
